<title>UK: Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following pfandbrief bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Trinkaus &amp; Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN MARK  COUPON     5.5	 MATURITY    20.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.245    PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   LISTING    DUSS	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  22.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 459</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
